<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Commerzbank AG.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Commerzbank AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein AG said it has issued one million American-style call warrants, in three equal tranches, on Commerzbank AG, lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>ONE WARRANT CONTROLS ONE SHARE.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 20.JAN.97-18.JUL.97   PAYDATE	17.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSSELDORF     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  41.85 DEM</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRIKE	 ISSUE	  PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	 42 DEM	 2.56 DEM     6.48 PCT     16.35 X</p>
<p> CALL	 44 DEM	 1.71 DEM     9.22 PCT     24.47 X</p>
<p> CALL	 46 DEM	 1.10 DEM     12.54 PCT    38.05 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
